# HL7 v2 ER7 messages end every segment with a bare carriage return (0x0D),
# which is the terminator the standard fixes and the one the importer requires.
# No end-of-line conversion may touch these bytes on any platform: the
# fixtures are hashed, and their digests are pinned by the determinism suite.
*.hl7 -text

# The LIS CSV fixtures are byte-exact evidence of what the reader admits and
# refuses: one carries CRLF terminators on purpose, one carries a bare CR on
# purpose, and the packaged reference export has a pinned source digest. Git
# must not translate a line ending in any of them on the way in or out.
tests/fixtures/lis/*.csv -text
src/contextsafe/fixtures/reference/lis-export.csv -text
